      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu batwekere Yerusaalemu ebyana by'entaama ebi baihire Sela. Baabitwekera omulemi ow'ensi egi, nibabirabya omuhanda ogw'irungu, baabihikya ha rusozi orw'abantu ba Siyoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkooku orora enyonyi ezirukuteera amapapa, nkooku orora obwana bw'enyonyi obuto nuho burarangira, abantu ba Mowabbu na bo, nukwo bali bati ha myogo y'Arunooni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibagamba abantu ba Yuda bati: “Mutugambire eki muraakora, mutuswekerre nk'omuti oku guleeta ekiituuru omu bwire bw'ihangwe, mutuleke tuhuumule omu kiituuru kyanyu. Tuli basuuhuuki, mutusereke nambere tutasobora kuzoorwa muntu n'omu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutuleke twikale omunsi yanyu. Mutujune abo abarukwenda kutuhwerekereza. Ogu kabonabonesa obu aliba atakyaroho, okuhwerekerezibwa kuculiire, kandi anyakurubatirra abantu obu aliba arugire omunsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu, nubwo omu ha baijukuru ba Daudi aliteera engoma, aliremesa, obwinganiza n'engonzi, araayanguhaga kukora ekihikire, kandi araakoraga kyona eki asobora okugendera ha bwinganiza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tukahurraho okwekuliiriza kw'abantu ba Mowabbu. Tubamanyire nkooku beehemba kandi nkooku beekuliiriza, baitu okwehaanira kwabo kwa busa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, Mowabbu ateere omukungo, abantu boona baterre Mowabbu empamo. Obu baraijukaga ebyokulya ebirungi ebi baalyaga omu rubuga Kiruharaseesi; balihwa amasiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasamba n'emisiri eya Hesibooni ehwerekeriire emisiri egi eyajungwamuga amarwa agaatamirizaaga Yazeri, ha bukiizi obwa Burugaizooba eyesimba ha rubaju orumu orw'enyanja Enfu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati, nindirirra omuzabbibbu gwa Sihuna nkooku ndirirra Yazeri. Nindirirra Hesibooni n'Eryeri, habwokuba timwina eby'okugesa ebyokusembereza abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu misiri egi ey'orwezo, busayo muntu n'omu arukusemererwa, omu misiri ey'emizabbibbu, busayo n'omu arukutoka rundi arukuziha. Busaho arukurubata emizabbibbu kujunga amarwa; etoko ey'okusemererwa ngifuuhize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, ninsinda habw'obujune obu nyina habwa Mowabbu, habw'obusaalizi obu ndukuhurra habwa Kiriheresi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba Mowabbu noobu balyeyoleka, noobu balyejwahiza omu kiikaro ekikuru, noobu baligenda omu kiikaro kyabo ekirukwera kusaba, tibaligira mugaso ogu baihamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki nikyo ekigambo MUKAMA eki yagambire ira hali Mowabbu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi hati naagamba ati: “Omu kasumi ak'emyaka esatu, nk'ey'omuntu kakolerra empeera, Abamowabbu noobu baraaba bali baingi bata, balitandika kuganya! Kandi abo abaliba basigaireho, baliba mbarwa kandi baceke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
